cmu-hijack-launch-unavailable = Launch unavailable: insufficient fuel, quantum jump in progress, or telemetry destroyed.
cmu-hijack-evacuation-started = Emergency. All personnel must evacuate immediately. Lifeboats activated.
cmu-hijack-evacuation-cancelled = Evacuation has been cancelled.
cmu-hijack-start = Critical damage sustained to ship systems. Altitude rapidly decreasing. Initiating sublight burn to exit the area. Maintain fueling functionality to initiate a quantum jump.
cmu-hijack-online = Online
cmu-hijack-no-life-signs = No marine life signs detected aboard. Suspending hyperdrive objective control; maintaining the current flight state.
cmu-hijack-offline = Offline
cmu-hijack-area-state = {$area} — {$state}
cmu-hijack-progress-25 = Emergency fuel replenishment is at 50%. Tachyon field accelerators currently charging. Early lifeboat launch override available.
cmu-hijack-progress-50 = Emergency fuel replenishment is at 100%. Tachyon field accelerators fully charged, quantum jump initiating. Ensure a constant fuel supply.
cmu-hijack-progress-75 = Tachyon quantum jump progress at 50 percent. Ensure constant fuel supply to the tachyon field accelerators.
cmu-hijack-progress-100 = Tachyon quantum jump complete. Initiating docking procedures. Lifeboats and pods re-enabled.
cmu-hijack-xeno-progress = The talls are {$progress}% of the way towards their goals. Disable the following areas: {$areas}
cmu-hijack-ftl-charging = Initiating quantum jump. Opening virtual mass field. Lifeboats and pods disabled until arrival.
cmu-hijack-ftl-entered = ALERT: Prolonged exposure outside hypersleep chambers during a tachyon quantum jump can be fatal. Seek hypersleep chambers if possible.
cmu-hijack-arrived = Quantum jump complete. Preparing to dock at the emergency rendezvous.
cmu-hijack-docked = Emergency rendezvous reached. Lifeboats and pods are available. Maintain quarantine of the ship.
cmu-hijack-ftl-failure = Tachyon quantum jump drive deactivated due to insufficient fueling. Brace for destabilization of the hyperdrive field.
cmu-hijack-ground-failure = Tachyon quantum jump drive deactivated due to insufficient fueling. Entry into atmosphere imminent. Brace for impact.
cmu-hijack-ground-impact = ALERT: Lifeboat telemetry destroyed during atmospheric reentry. Evacuation via port and starboard lifeboats is no longer possible.
cmu-hijack-pumps-overloading = ALERT: Build-up detected within pumping systems. Overload in ten seconds.
cmu-hijack-self-destruct-unlocked = Remaining fuel transferred to onboard fusion generators to permit scuttling. Engineers can overload reactor safeties with a multitool.
cmu-hijack-reactor-inoperable = The reactor must be working, fueled, and have external power.
cmu-hijack-reactor-overloaded = The reactor safeties are overloaded.
cmu-hijack-reactor-restored = The reactor safeties have been restored.
cmu-hijack-reactor-stopped = You strike the reactor, stopping its overload process!
cmu-hijack-reactor-safeties = The overloaded reactor does not respond. Restore its safeties with a multitool.
cmu-hijack-reactor-multitool = A trained engineer can overload or restore its safeties using a multitool.
cmu-hijack-reactor-countdown = Overloaded generators: {$generators}. Meltdown time remaining: {$seconds} seconds. The countdown pauses when no generators are overloaded.
cmu-hijack-xeno-overload = The talls may be attempting to take their ship down with them in Engineering. Stop them!
cmu-hijack-reactor-hot = Reactor room temperature has reached 90 degrees Celsius.
cmu-hijack-reactor-halfway = ALERT: Fusion reactor meltdown has reached fifty percent.
cmu-hijack-reactor-superheated = Reactor room temperature has reached 120 degrees Celsius.
cmu-hijack-pump-destroyed = The fuel pump is destroyed beyond repair.
cmu-hijack-pump-integrity = Fuel pump integrity: {$integrity}%.
cmu-hijack-deck-creak = The ship's deck worryingly creaks underneath you.
cmu-hijack-meltdown = ALERT: Fusion reactors dangerously overloaded. Runaway meltdown in the reactor core imminent.
cmu-hijack-ground-result = Xenomorph major victory: the ship crashed onto the planet.
cmu-hijack-self-destruct-result = Mutual annihilation: the ship was destroyed in a nuclear explosion.
